{"id":"zweifellos","lemma":"zweifellos","pos":"adj","rank":3399,"glosses":["doubtless"],"ipa":"/ˈtsvaɪ̯fl̩loːs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/01/De-zweifellos.ogg/De-zweifellos.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"zweifelloser","superlative":"am zweifellosesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist zweifellos wahr.","en":"This is without a doubt true.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"true, real"}]},{"text":"Sie haben zweifellos einen Fehler gemacht.","en":"They must have made a mistake.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"fault, error, mistake"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte zweifellos Glück.","en":"I was certainly lucky.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757082","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"happiness, joy, bliss"}]},{"text":"Es sieht zweifellos nach Regen aus.","en":"It certainly looks like rain.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"rain"},{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Es ist zweifellos das Bessere von beiden.","en":"It's undoubtedly the better of the two.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to improve, to better","l":"bessern"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"both","l":"beide"}]}]}